OL,3,GNEWSAThe nail salon 'fully booked' with
OL,4,Amen for masculinity challenge
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt is a Friday evening and the lights
OL,7,Fare still on at a nail salon in
OL,8,FSheffield's Neepsend district.
OL,10,FBut it is not quite business as usual
OL,11,Ffor the team at Offbeat Beauty
OL,12,FCollective tonight.
OL,14,FIn fact, it is the first time they've
OL,15,Fever been fully booked with male
OL,16,Fcustomers.
OL,18,FSome, like Ewan Bray, who's opted for
OL,19,F"a lovely fuchsia and glitter colour",
OL,20,Fhave been "gently persuaded" by their
OL,21,Fwives or girlfriends to get their nails
OL,22,Fdone.
OL,23,APub: 27-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
